<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107844" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερσαρκ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>have</i> or <i>get an excess of flesh,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τὸ ἕλκος</span>
			<i>grows proud</i> or <i>fungous flesh,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VC</u>
				15
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερσαρκίσῃ</span> is f.l.),
			cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.191
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τρυφῆς καὶ ἀδηφαγίας ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nymphis
					16
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				9.13
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
